<title>AUSTRIA: VA Stahl sees 48 pct fall in 1996 net.</title>
<headline>VA Stahl sees 48 pct fall in 1996 net.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian steel maker VA Stahl said on Tuesday its preliminary 1996 net profit was nearly halved to 1.6 billion schillings from 3.071 billion schillings a year ago, adding it expected similar results this year.</p>
<p>In a statement, VA Stahl said 1996 had been a &quot;good year&quot; despite an overall weak economy and a fall in demand.</p>
